  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging Rwanda&#xb4;s Gap: Enhancing access to child health services and clean water.
With the objective of preventing disease through the expansion of primary health care and improvement of access to water supply.
Key Results expected:
&#x2022;	At least 240,000 under-five children have access to integrated child health and immunization services in primary health care
&#x2022;	At least 10,000 people, gain access to equitable, sustainable and climate-resilient water supply services.</narrative>
  </description>
